| [BCP 47] | BCP 47: Tags for Identifying Languages, available at <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/bcp47/>. |
| [DTV] | Date-Time Vocabulary (DTV™). Available at <https://www.omg.org/spec/DTV/>. |
